        "Id" : "event_co_oldFriend_Pirate",
        "Name" : "A Friend from the Old Days",
        "Details" : "Rackam\u2026? Through your rush of old memories, Darius goes on. \"He claims to be a friend from your racing days. I'll put him through to your quarters.\"\r\n\r\nRackam's voice has weathered with age. \"It's been a long time, {COMMANDER.FirstName}. I've heard you've been busy. Me too. But let's not beat around the bush\u2026 I need a favor.\"\r\n\r\nHe was told to lose a race but decided to win instead and got into trouble with the bookies who tried to get him to throw the event. Now he needs a place to lay low with his pit crew and his now-damaged racer until his agent can smooth things over and he's willing to pay for the shelter.",
