                        "Name" : "Low MechTech penalty",
                        "Details" : "Rackam's ragtag pit crew arrives with little fanfare. As Yang gets Rackam's ride, the <i>Red Menace</i>, loaded into the Vehicle Hangar, the pit crew stares in awe at the DropShip.\r\n\r\nRackam lumbers over, a mountain of a man at the best of times. \"You've got a very interesting bird here, {COMMANDER.FirstName}. Do I get a tour?\"\r\n\r\n\"Of course. I only wish I could provide more support for your crew.\" Gesturing broadly as you make your way deeper into the ship, \"Even with all of this, there's one thing that hasn't changed. It's the crew that makes the man.\"",
