                        "Name" : "Larger MechTech penalty",
                        "Details" : "Rackam's ragtag pit crew arrives with little fanfare. As Yang gets Rackam's ride, the <i>Red Menace</i>, loaded into the Vehicle Hangar, the pit crew stares in awe at the DropShip.\r\n\r\nRackam lumbers over, a mountain of a man at the best of times, and offers his hand. \"You've got a very interesting bird here, {COMMANDER.FirstName}. Do I get a tour?\"\r\n\r\nUnexpectedly, [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] appears at your shoulder. \"Commander?\" {SCN_MW.SUBJ_C}{SCN_MW.Gender?NonBinary:'re|Default:'s} talking to Rackam.\r\n\r\nRackam is as surprised as you are. \"I never expected to see <i>you</i> again! I'm glad to see that you've landed here, though.\" He turns to you. \"{COMMANDER.Callsign} always did have a talent for working with the best.\"",
