                        "Id" : "outcome_3_0",
                        "Name" : "Larger MechTech penalty",
                        "Details" : "Rackam's ragtag pit crew arrives with little fanfare. As Yang gets Rackam's ride, the <i>Red Menace</i>, loaded into the Vehicle Hangar, the pit crew stares in awe at the DropShip.\r\n\r\nRackam lumbers over, a mountain of a man at the best of times, and offers his hand. \"I'd be thrilled to race against you again, {COMMANDER.FirstName}! It'll be just like the old days doing the New Avalon Rally Championships!\" He calls over one of his crew and they get you set up with one of Rackam's backup cars, the <i>Blue Devil</i>.\r\n\r\nOver the course of the next few days, you and Rackam do race after race out in the local back country. The crew, both yours and Rackam's, take as many Holovids as they possibly can of the races, Rackam's crew to sell as promo vids later and your crew to watch and enjoy over the coming months. Everyone agrees though that both racers are fantastic drivers, even if Rackam wins the majority of the races.",
